    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36869" root="كردح" body-key="k">
    
      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْدَحَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْدَحَةٌ</span>, <i>He</i> (a short man)
<i>ran with short steps, and quickly;</i> as also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْتَحَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْمَحَ</span>. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He</i> (an ass) <i>ran
leaning on one side;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْدَمَ</span>. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<i>He went slowly.</i> (IAar.)

